# Citation metadata for SuperfluidDynamics.jl
# https://citation-file-format.github.io/
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SuperfluidDynamics.jl: a Julia package for simulating superfluids"
abstract: >-
  Julia package for simulating superfluids: Gross-Pitaevskii (imaginary and
  real time), Bogoliubov-de Gennes excitations, incompressible Navier-Stokes,
  the coupled Gross-Pitaevskii / Navier-Stokes two-fluid model and the linear
  Hall-Vinen-Bekarevich-Khalatnikov model. Spectral and finite-difference
  derivatives, CPU and GPU, distributed-memory parallelism through
  PencilArrays.
authors:
  - family-names: "Lothodé"
    given-names: "Corentin"
    email: "corentin.lothode@inrae.fr"
    affiliation: "IRHS, INRAE"
repository-code: "https://plmlab.math.cnrs.fr/lothode/SuperfluidDynamics.jl"
repository-artifact: "https://plmlab.math.cnrs.fr/lothode/SuperfluidDynamics.jl/-/releases"
keywords:
  - julia
  - superfluidity
  - bose-einstein-condensate
  - gross-pitaevskii
  - bogoliubov-de-gennes
  - navier-stokes
  - hvbk
  - quantum-turbulence
  - spectral-method
  - mpi
  - gpu
license: MIT
version: 2.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-06
